      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements:\n    -> We can have multiple users playing chess at the same time\n    -> Score based match making algorithms\n    -> We have standard chess rules but can be scalabale\n    -> Users within a match can also send / recieve messages \n    -> User can quit the match in between",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements:\n    -> We can have multiple users playing chess at the same time\n    -> Score based match making algorithms\n    -> We have standard chess rules but can be scalabale\n    -> Users within a match can also send / recieve messages \n    -> User can quit the match in between",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
